data: {"id": "8791eb2534e94b7c-thinking-parallel_evidence-162", "run_id": "8791eb2534e94b7c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=488 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [5] 综合 Prometheus Metrics、K8s 状态", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788426607080, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_64ba26aeca46420ab30398c4", "tool_sequence": 8, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=488 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [5] 综合 Prometheus Metrics、K8s 状态、事件、Spec 得出结论\n[✓] [1] verify-pod-status-and-events: 获取 Pod JSON 状态和事件\n[✓] [2] verify-pod-spec-volume-mounts: 获取 Pod YAML 检查 volume/secret 引用\n[✓] [3] verify-pod-events: 获取 Pod 事件列表\n[✓] [4] 补证: 用 kubectl describe secret 验证 Secret 是否真的缺少 unavailable-key\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8791eb2534e94b7c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8791eb2534e94b7c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8791eb2534e94b7c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

